				<description>&lt;p&gt;The documentation for the $132,000 for court-ordered child support is in the original court documents, posted here &#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://emesshalom18.github.io/emesvshalom-site/financial-overview/documentation/&#34;&gt;Documentation&lt;/a&gt;&#xA; , and is an ongoing, regular monthly bill.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;So too, taking the income earned from the properties, $70,365, is documented here &#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://emesshalom18.github.io/emesvshalom-site/financial-overview/documentation/&#34;&gt;Documentation&lt;/a&gt;&#xA; and is likewise ongoing and approximately the same amounts every year.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Update: this stopped in 2016, as the last child was emancipated.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
